#: setup.php
msgid "Warning Latency Notification"
msgstr "Imenyesha ry'iburira ku bukererwe"

#: setup.php
msgid "If a Device has a Round Trip Ping Latency above the Warning Threshold and above the Criticality below, subscribing emails to the Device will receive an email notification.  Select 'Disabled' to Disable.  The Thold Plugin is required to enable this feature."
msgstr "Niba Igikoresho gifite Ubukererwe bwa Ping yo Kugenda no Kugaruka burenze Urwego ntarengwa rw'Iburira kandi burenze Ubukana buri hasi, imeyili ziyandikishije ku Gikoresho zizabona imenyesha rya imeyili.  Hitamo 'Byahagaritswe' kugira ngo uhagarike.  Umugereka wa Thold urakenewe kugira ngo ufungure iyi mikorere."

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert Latency Notification"
msgstr "Imenyesha ry'ubukererwe bw'Integuza"

#: setup.php
msgid "If a Device has a Round Trip Ping Latency above the Alert Threshold and above the Criticality below, subscribing emails to the Device will receive an email notification.  Select 'Disabled' to Disable.  The Thold Plugin is required to enable this feature."
msgstr "Niba Igikoresho gifite Ubukererwe bwa Ping yo Kugenda no Kugaruka burenze Urwego ntarengwa rw'Impuruza kandi burenze Ubukana buri hasi, imeyili ziyandikishije ku Gikoresho zizabona imenyesha rya imeyili.  Hitamo 'Byahagaritswe' kugira ngo uhagarike.  Umugereka wa Thold urakenewe kugira ngo ufungure iyi mikorere."

