#: setup.php
msgid "Ping Warning Threshold"
msgstr "Urwego ntarengwa rw'Iburira rwa Ping"

#: setup.php
msgid "If the round-trip latency via any of the predefined Cacti ping methods raises above this threshold, log a warning or send email based upon the Devices Criticality and Monitor setting.  The unit is in milliseconds.  Setting to 0 disables. The Thold Plugin is required to leverage this functionality."
msgstr "Niba igihe cyo kugenda no kugaruka hakoreshejwe bumwe mu buryo bwa ping bwa Cacti bwateganyijwe kirenze uru rwego ntarengwa, andika iburira mu nyandiko y'ibikorwa cyangwa wohereze Imeyili ukurikije uburemere bw'Ibikoresho n'igenamiterere ryo Kugenzura. Igipimo ni muri milisegonda. Gushyira kuri 0 birabihagarika. Umugereka wa Thold urakenewe kugira ngo ukoreshe iyi mikorere."

#: setup.php
msgid "milliseconds"
msgstr "milisegonda"

#: setup.php
msgid "Ping Alert Threshold"
msgstr "Urwego ntarengwa rw'integuza ya Ping"

#: setup.php
msgid "If the round-trip latency via any of the predefined Cacti ping methods raises above this threshold, log an alert or send an email based upon the Devices Criticality and Monitor setting.  The unit is in milliseconds.  Setting to 0 disables. The Thold Plugin is required to leverage this functionality."
msgstr "Niba igihe cyo kugenda no kugaruka hakoreshejwe bumwe mu buryo bwa ping bwa Cacti bwateganyijwe kirenze uru rwego ntarengwa, andika impuruza mu nyandiko y'ibikorwa cyangwa wohereze Imeyili ukurikije uburemere bw'Ibikoresho n'igenamiterere ryo Kugenzura. Igipimo ni muri milisegonda. Gushyira kuri 0 birabihagarika. Umugereka wa Thold urakenewe kugira ngo ukoreshe iyi mikorere."

#: setup.php
msgid "Re-Baseline Warning"
msgstr "Iburira ryo gusubiramo urufatiro"

#: setup.php
msgid "The percentage above the current average ping time to consider a Warning Threshold.  If updated, this will automatically adjust the Ping Warning Threshold."
msgstr "Ijanisha riri hejuru y'igihe mpuzandengo cya ping kiriho ubu kugira ngo rifatwe nk'Urwego ntarengwa rw'Iburira.  Iyo bivuguruwe, ibi bihita bihindura ku buryo bwikora Urwego ntarengwa rw'Iburira rya Ping."

#: setup.php
msgid "Re-Baseline Alert"
msgstr "Impuruza yo gusubiramo urufatiro"

#: setup.php
msgid "The percentage above the current average ping time to consider a Alert Threshold.  If updated, this will automatically adjust the Ping Alert Threshold."
msgstr "Ijanisha riri hejuru y'igihe mpuzandengo cya ping kiriho ubu kugira ngo rifatwe nk'Urwego ntarengwa rw'Impuruza.  Iyo bivuguruwe, ibi bihita bihindura ku buryo bwikora Urwego ntarengwa rw'Impuruza ya Ping."

